  "diagnosticHistory": [
    "The pre-rollout Web negative probe demonstrated that an anonymous caller could open Community Chat; the production auth-boundary migration closes that defect.",
    "The first Web UI retry used a canvas-intercepted locator and was superseded by the demonstrated semantic-center click helper.",
    "A subsequent Web run used a stale distribution without the one-shot fault hook; the exact candidate distribution was rebuilt before the passing run.",
    "The first iOS run passed the fault flag only to XCTest rather than to the application under test; the failed report and log remain in the local evidence history and the corrected exact-HEAD rerun passed.",
